### 變數設定
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/roomtask
@authUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/auth
@taskId = 10

### 0. 登入獲取 JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 自動綁定 Token 變數
@jwtToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### --------------------------------------------------------

### 1. GET 查詢所有房務任務
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2. 依條件過濾任務 (RequestParam 查詢)
# 2.1 依任務 ID 查詢 (回傳 List)
GET {{baseUrl}}?taskId={{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2.2 依房間 ID 查詢
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomId=15
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2.3 依員工 ID 查詢
GET {{baseUrl}}?employeeId=21
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2.4 依優先級查詢 (例如：緊急、重要、一般)
GET {{baseUrl}}?priority=緊急
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3. GET 依 ID 查詢單一房務任務 (PathVariable 查詢)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 4. POST 新增房務任務
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 111,
  "employeeId": 2,
  "remark": "馬桶堵塞",
  "priority": "緊急",
  "taskType": "設備維修",
  "taskStatus": "待處理"
}

### 5. PUT 修改房務任務資訊 (修改 ID = {{taskId}} 的資料)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 7,
  "employeeId": 2,
  "remark": "馬桶堵塞已檢修完成",
  "priority": "普通",
  "taskType": "設備維修",
  "taskStatus": "已完成"
}

### 6. DELETE 刪除房務任務 (刪除 ID = {{taskId}} 的資料)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}